
title: Luca
---
<<declare $helpedLuca = false>>
<<declare $lucaDrinks = false>>

<<if $helpedLuca>>
    Luca: Thanks again for helping me!
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>

Luca: Hey! I am going to propose today and I need your help. Are you free today?

-> No, sorry.
    <<jump DeclineLuca>>
-> \[ACTION\] Yeah, I have time. <<if getBool("hasChapelPass")>>
        <<jump HelpLuca>>
===

title: HelpLuca
---
<<useAction>>
<<set $helpedLuca = true>>
Luca: Perfect! I want her to be in the Quad by the Afternoon. Convince her to be there during class, ok? Thanks!
<<stop>>
===

title: DeclineLuca
---
Luca: That's okay! I got this! Yea! All by myself! Hmmmm....
<<stop>>
===

title: LucaLate
---
<<if getBool("teacherDistracted")>>
    Luca: Ah Sweet! He didn't notice me coming in! 
<<else>>
    Prof: I see you slept in again...

    Luca: Sorry, I'm a chud.

    Prof: We know...
<<endif>>

<<if getBool("lukeHasPaper")>>
    Luke: Sweet! Luca being late bought me some time. See if he can keep the Prof occupied, he can probably handle it.
<<endif>>

<<stop>>
===

title: LucaClass
---
<<if !getBool("teacherDistracted")>>
    <<if getBool("samBus")>>
        <<jump LucaClearClass>>
    <<endif>>
    <<if getBool("lucaSamBus")>>
        <<jump LucaNarcClass>>
    <<endif>>
    Luca: Dang it, he noticed I was late. I need to get back in his good graces, or I'll have to see him in office hours later.
    Luca: What do I do?
    -> \[ACTION\] Throw Sam under the bus for being even later.
        <<jump LucaThrowSam>>
    -> \[ACTION\] Tell the Prof a joke.
        <<jump Joke>>
    -> Go back.
        <<stop>>
<<else>>
    Luca: Phew! I snuck in! What a relief!
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Joke
---
<<setBool "lucaSamBus" true>>
<<useAction>>
Luca: What's brown and sticky?
Prof: A stick?
Luca: ...
Prof: That was lame.
===

title: LucaThrowSam
---
<<setBool "samBus" true>>
<<useAction>>
Luca: Excuse me, Prof, Sam still isn't here, right?

===

title: LucaClearClass
---
Luca: Let's go! Glad that worked.
===

title: LucaNarcClass
---
Luca: Ugh. Office hours again.
===

title: LucaLunchStart
---

<<if getBool("postersHung") && !$lucaDrinks>>
    <<jump LucaLunchMilk>>
<<else>>
    <<if $lucaDrinks>>
        Luca: Find a way to get Sam to not attend! Ask others for some help.
    <<else>>
        <<jump LucaLunchDefault>>
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
===

title: LucaLunchMilk
---
Luca: Hey, saw those posters y'all hung up. Can't wait to attend!
-> \[ACTION\] Can you get some drinks for us? <<if getBool("lukeHasSpeaker")>>
    Luca: ... Are you a cop?
    -> ...
        Luca: I'm just messing with ya. I just stocked up on "milk" earlier. Heck, I'm drinking some right now!
        -> Ok...
            Luca: Anyway, Sam said he's coming to the party tonight. He's an RA; he will totally kill the vibe. Find a way to make sure he doesn't show up, and the "milk" is yours!
            -> Sure.
                <<set $lucaDrinks = true>>
                <<useAction>>
                <<stop>>
-> See you there!
    <<stop>>

===

title: LucaLunchDefault
---
Luca: Don't mind me, just enjoying my drink and grilled nuggets!

===

title: LucaGivesMilk
---

Luca: Dang Sam got hit by a stray! He isn't gonna come to the party after that! 
Luca: Here's all the "milk" I got.
<<setBool "hasMilk" true>>
<<if numActions() == 0>>
    Luke: Let's go to Ket Rec for the party!
<<else>>
    Luke: Make sure to eat lunch and then we can go to Ket Rec for the party!
<<endif>>

===

